---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Rules" description="DeadMTL server rules — code of conduct, no-pay-to-win policy, and Season 0 guidelines.">

<section class="term-hero" style="padding-block: clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);">
  <div class="th__inner">
    <div class="th__eyebrow">Server Doctrine // Season 0</div>
    <div class="th__headline" style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem,5vw,3.5rem);">Rules</div>
    <p class="th__body">
      Code of conduct, no-pay-to-win policy, whitelist behavior, and admin authority.
      Provisional for Season 0. Read before applying.
    </p>
    <div class="th__cta">
      <a href="/join/" class="term-btn term-btn--teal">Join Info &rsaquo;</a>
      <a href="/" class="term-btn term-btn--ghost">&larr; Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="home-section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 840px;">

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag th__tag--amber">Provisional</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
        <span class="th__info">Season 0 Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.65;">
        These rules are a working draft. They will be finalized before applications open.
        Connecting to DeadMTL means you have read and accepted them.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">[ 01 ] Code of Conduct</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <ul style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.75; padding-left: 1rem; list-style: none;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No harassment, hate speech, targeted insults, or abuse of any player.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No discrimination based on language, background, origin, or identity.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No doxxing, sharing of personal information, or threats outside the game.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No impersonation of admins, operators, or other players.</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>English and French are both welcome. Be patient with second-language players.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag th__tag--red">[ 02 ] No Pay-to-Win</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <ul style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.75; padding-left: 1rem; list-style: none;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--red);">&rsaquo;</span>DeadMTL will never sell weapons, XP, loot, safehouses, map locations, or any gameplay advantage.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--red);">&rsaquo;</span>Donor status, if it ever exists, will not grant items, inventory slots, or spawn protection.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--red);">&rsaquo;</span>Admins do not spawn items for players. No exceptions, no matter who asks.</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--red);">&rsaquo;</span>Any external transaction that grants a gameplay edge is a ban-level offense.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">[ 03 ] Cheating and Exploits</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <ul style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.75; padding-left: 1rem; list-style: none;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No cheating, hacks, modified clients, or external tools that affect gameplay.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>No duplication glitches, item spawning, or out-of-bounds abuse.</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>Report bugs to admins rather than exploiting them. Abuse results in ban.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="term-panel">
      <div class="term-header">
        <span class="th__tag">[ 04 ] Admin and Whitelist</span>
        <span class="th__rule"></span>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;">
        <ul style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.75; padding-left: 1rem; list-style: none;">
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>Access requires a whitelist application. Anonymous joins not allowed.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>Admin decisions are final during Season 0. Appeals by DM only.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>Severe violations result in immediate permanent ban.</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative;"><span style="position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--teal);">&rsaquo;</span>Ban evasion with alternate accounts results in permanent ban of all accounts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

</Base>
